<title>GREECE: Greek M3 rises provisionally 15.4pct yr/yr in June.</title>
<headline>Greek M3 rises provisionally 15.4pct yr/yr in June.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greek M3 money supply grew a provisional 15.4 percent year-on-year in June after an upwardly revised 15.8 percent in May, overshooting the central bank's 6.0-9.0 percent target range for end-1997, the Bank of Greece said in a statement.</p>
</text>
